feel like he did something,

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:24.410
because he grew up under a mom who didn't

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:25.569
give him confidence.

00:09:25.569 --> 00:09:27.743
So, at the same token to your point,

00:09:27.743 --> 00:09:29.780
when I'm saying, "Fuck your parents,"

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:32.223
I'm saying it's more of a way

00:09:32.223 --> 00:09:33.589
to break through to kids to say,

00:09:33.589 --> 00:09:35.474
"Look, you need to lean in to your truth.

00:09:35.474 --> 00:09:37.906
"You need to have empathy
for why your parents

00:09:37.906 --> 00:09:39.568
